{\"commitments\": [\"Statistical Disentanglement: MI-based non-param opt on msg feats.\", \"Representational Disentanglement: Encoder reg for attack-specific feats.\", \"Dynamic Graph Diffusion: TemporalGNNConv or custom on multi-layer (but layers all 0).\", \"Multi-scale Fusion: Fuse multi-layer reps for few-shot proto nets.\", \"Baselines: SVM on feats, GraphSAGE/E-GraphSAGE edge class, approx 3D-IDS.\", \"Scenarios: Binary/multi-class on chrono splits; few-shot: 1/5-shot on rare attacks (0,1,9); unknown: holdout unseen attacks.\", \"Metrics: Acc, F1-macro/micro/weighted, per-class F1, AUC-ROC/PR.\"]}